    "description": "The persona screens (projects, project page, CAR form, approval screen, inbox) render server-side from pm-core with the browser's pm_session cookie. Without one, pm-core answers 401 and the page redirects to pm-core's sign-in carrying the page as return_to. The signed-in walk is tests/login/screens_test.go.",
    "status": "active",
    "test_type": "contract",
    "priority": "high"
  },
